' S-105 (Mete karari 2026-09-20): erisim belirteci YAZILMAMIS sinif uyesi PUBLIC'tir.
' Alan ve yontemlere sinifin disindan erisilebilir; acik PRIVATE/PROTECTED/RESTRICTED degismez.
CLASS Counter
    n AS I32
    METHOD Bump()
        THIS.n = THIS.n + 1
    END METHOD
    METHOD Value() AS I32
        RETURN THIS.n
    END METHOD
END CLASS
DIM c AS Counter
c = NEW Counter()
c.Bump()
c.Bump()
PRINT c.Value()
c.n = 40
PRINT c.n
c.Bump()
PRINT c.Value()